{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_03_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d735317fc074598b4036684fdd9a2a0484908f4e2028dee4d886916839bb30c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f1761f8a37c4893c583a65d60bd3a4b259eaca7cc0235aff11185b00feba34",
      "text": "（虽说听说了除了我之外还有其他人\n来参加试镜……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dbe98074c83be1f3d52b559af98159e8c26270fd23f15e24bece0885011f006",
      "text": "（那不是之前出外景的时候，见过的孩子嘛。\n……是清澄家的少爷呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0440dad8166f6addc0dee2e652209694cd14ad90b69f0c123daf4a887c109ae0",
      "text": "（还记得我……应该不可能吧。\n只有一瞬间，而且当时人又那么多）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3d2df049b466af861f385bbf1e27cb96c77196ce8aa20ce5ffedcaf1982150",
      "text": "（当时我也这么觉得，真是个引人注目的存在啊。\n自带光彩呢。让人忍不住想看他）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d72c687eebef3ab93280402a566e580b77b634d9c9789b618841b549e3070d72",
      "text": "（那位制作人，还挺有眼光的嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68d966a8aa12073bf4c26217fa98af154d69a17d57e7803749fd3df8dee0b2d",
      "text": "（虽然看起来是个新成立的事务所，但照这架势，\n旗下的偶像水准应该会很高呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae3b4a79094bbdc623d666fe879f087c7d2f0b2e0338a09ea2fa419fa7ea709",
      "text": "（精神紧绷起来了！\n我也得拿出真本事才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad87be148f6ff2954611324f9fb8a46e508baf88ac9b4399b04f64c901538c7",
      "text": "（这位是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d677e783e663586d30fc484a9099c6f8f21635a780d7a417b0effce622d7d4cd",
      "text": "（不就是前几天祖父说的，因为门第出身\n而无法出演主角的那位吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60d34e9e494cb98782ee177549c36df54ace7ecfef32accfd970374a31ef836f",
      "text": "（即使在歌舞伎以外的舞台上大放异彩，\n那也是为了守护传统）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b463dd112f09dc50df92987334105d47297bf6399dc400f43f792b4406bfffbb",
      "text": "（祖父甚至还拿我上电视和杂志的事\n来作对比……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
